<div class="srvmon-sec">Unraid OS and plugins<small>uses the result of Unraid's own update checks</small></div>

Notify about Unraid OS updates:
: <?=sm_yn($sm,'CHECK_OS_UPDATES')?>

Notify about plugin updates:
